  <div class="modal fade" id="downtime-notification" data-bs-backdrop="static" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="staticBackdropLabel" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-xl downt--top01" role="document">
      <div class="modal-content donlod--pop">
          <h5 class="modal-title" id="staticBackdropLabel" style="color: #f7546e;">Namaste Partner</h5>
          <button type="button" class="close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close">
            <span aria-hidden="true"> <i class="ti-close"></i> </span>
          </button>
          <div class="shape1"><img src="https://xtratrust.com/assets/front/img/down01.png"></div>
        <div class="modal-body">
          <div class="dwn--inner--02">
            <p>We are excited to inform you that we will be implementing a new DSC issuance process in line with <span>CCA IVG Guidelines 2.4, from July 15th, 2024.

            </span> As a part of this upgrade, we will be performing a system maintenance downtime starting from <span>11:00 AM on June 14th, 2024 (this Sunday) until 10:00 AM on July 15th, 2024 (Monday).</span></p>

            <h3>To ensure a seamless transition, please take note of the following crucial steps:</h3>

            <ul>
                <li>1. Backup your existing DSC Stock, Wallet, and reports - if any - to avoid any data loss.</li>

                 <li>2. Complete all pending enrolments by the cut-off time, as all unprocessed records need to be deleted from your Partner login before the downtime.

                 </li>  
                 <li>3. For applications marked as "Ready To Download", you can access them within 30 days from the Video Approval date.</li> 
                 <li>4. Ensure that all government purchase orders are completed before the said deadline; any remaining DSCs will be issued using our new issuance process.</li>
                 <li>5. You can access the XtraTrust Business Partner Application at <a href="https://business.xtratrust.com/login" target="_blank">https://business.xtratrust.com/login</a>  to manage your account.</li>
                 <li>6. Kindly update your bank details in your XtraTrust Partner login Profile section to facilitate payment settlements.</li>
                 <li>7. As a pre-requisite, please digitally sign the "Business Partner Agreement" and "Associate Partner Agreement" when you log in to your account on July 15th, 2024.</li>
                 <li>8.  You will still be able to create business partner and branch users as per standard procedure through Partner KYC.</li>
                    
            </ul>

            <h5>We appreciate your cooperation and understanding in this regard and look forward to continuing to work together.</h5>

          </div>
          <div class="thankuu">
<h4>Thank you <span>Team XtraTrust</span></h4>
          </div>
        </div>
        
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

